## Algorithm for bank account management using stack and queue dynamic implementation

1.Start.
2.Initialize top = NULL.
3.For the Push operation, create a new node.
4.Store the banking operation in the new node.
5.Link the new node to the current top.
6.Update top to the new node.
7.For the Pop operation, check whether the Stack is empty.
8.If it is empty, display an underflow message.
9.Otherwise, remove the top node and update the top pointer.
10.Display the Stack when required.
11.Stop.
